# Katla — Backend mühendislik yol haritası

Kaynak belge. Uygulama sırasında özet kurallarla çelişirse bu hedef geçerlidir; mevcut PWA'yı faz faz köprüle.

**Stack:** Next.js 16 App Router + React 19 + TypeScript + SQLite (better-sqlite3) + Tailwind 4. Kod `src/` altında.

**Tüketici:** PWA şimdi; sonra RN/Flutter → saf JSON API.

## Deployment

`better-sqlite3` senkron, tek dosya. Serverless (Vercel) yok. `next start` ile tek Node process (VPS, Railway, Fly, Render). İleride Turso veya PostgreSQL; SQL izole `src/lib/db/`.

## Klasör (hedef)

```
src/app/api/auth/otp/request|verify  refresh  me
src/app/api/providers  [id]  [id]/packages  me/profile|availability|drop-points
src/app/api/orders  [id]  [id]/status|photos|review
src/app/api/payments/webhook  notifications
src/lib/db/client.ts migrate.ts
src/lib/auth/jwt.ts otp.ts middleware.ts
src/lib/services/orderService.ts providerService.ts pricingService.ts
src/lib/geo/distance.ts
src/lib/validation/*.schema.ts  (zod)
db/migrations/0001_init.sql …
scripts/seed.ts
```

## Şema özeti

- `users`: phone unique, role customer|provider|admin. Parola yok.
- `otp_codes`: code_hash, attempts, expires_at.
- `refresh_tokens`: token_hash, expires_at, revoked_at.
- `provider_profiles`: lat/lng, has_dryer, verification_status, commission_rate 0.10, rating_avg/count, completed_orders.
- `service_packages`: price_per_kg, min_order_amount, express_*.
- `drop_points`, `availability_slots` (day_of_week 0=Pazar, door|point|both).
- `orders`: status pending…disputed, delivery_mode, scheduled_window_*, estimated/actual weight, **price_per_kg_snapshot**, estimated/final_price.
- `order_status_history`, `order_photos` (dropoff|pickup|damage), `payments` (authorized|captured|refunded|failed + provider_reference), `reviews` (order unique, 1–5), `disputes`, `notifications`.

İndeks: orders customer/provider/status, provider_profiles(lat,lng).

## State machine

pending→accepted→dropped_off→washing→ironing→ready→completed; pending→rejected; accepted/dropped_off→cancelled; completed→disputed. Client status'una güvenme. Rol kısıtı service'te.

## API envelope

`{ data }` / `{ error: { code, message } }`.

Geo: SQL bbox + `haversineKm` JS.

## Güvenlik

zod her girdi; JWT 15 dk + refresh rotation; OTP rate limit; fiyat server; KVKK min veri, TC hash'siz yok; env secrets; mutasyon requireAuth.

## Fazlar

0 migrate+db+iskelet+zod/jwt → 1 OTP/JWT/me → 2 provider+geo → 3 orders CRUD → 4 status+history+photos → 5 notifications → 6 payment basit authorize/capture → 7 review aggregation → 8 disputes+admin → 9 rate limit, pino, Sentry, vitest services.

Her faz bitince curl/vitest, sonra **commit + GitHub'a push**. Test edilmemiş state machine üzerine özellik ekleme. Adımı GitHub'sız bırakma.
